ians and DIYers alike.<p></p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>3-in-1 Functionality – Crimps, strips, and cuts cables, streamlining cable preparation.</li><li>Supports Multiple Connectors – Compatible with RJ-45 (8P8C), RJ-12 (6P6C), and RJ-11 (6P4C) modular plugs.</li><li>Precision Crimping – Ensures secure and accurate termination for reliable network performance.</li><li>Ergonomic Design – Non-slip, soft-grip handles reduce hand fatigue for extended use.</li><li>Durable Construction – Built from hardened steel for strength and long-term use.</li><li>Safety Lock Mechanism – Built-in latch keeps the tool safely closed when not in use.</li></ul><p><br></p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/ingco-hmpcn2468r-modular-plug-crimper\">INGCO HMPCN2468R Modular Plug Crimper</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">750৳</span> \n       